8fb2444494839e1fd8f955f3703335","logical_entry_identity":"8865e9beffce432ea201bccde89065d0d28bd3912739e19bd5b2abdacddeda17","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"Can see EVERYTHING.","source_tag":"_t","target":"能看见一切事物。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"a49563ff74539dbeb7a1dd14d7a797aed817fa195148d9a5382cd6edcd83e324","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"3bb47fc315790dd1b7b19997d3e120d5d9fe1e3fe6c22324d2565f08948a6652","logical_entry_identity":"42fd609a269cd169bd76d2ce54765b11cc2e562f1311d67ff78596d01ca02f1b","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"Rocket Pod","source_tag":"talent name","target":"火箭发射器"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"9440413b81350defab2019f06883d2903e13be92a5067cf7bb102ab708f8f3ca","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"3bb826649c2149cbdc024ee1096b58c24ea232a31a9a0abed3aa3e7c9c3b333a","logical_entry_identity":"cf4d177adf0e727d68ddef5912b88fa1ae38de4353eb86e5c710d7d79d0bbad7","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"O #CRIMSON#AMAKTHEL#LAST#!  Rightful ruler of all touched by the sun's light or the core's warmth!  In the era of gods, You innovated when others remained stagnant.  The others were content to work with the same mold - a head, thin skin, a jointed endoskeleton - but You, You had scores of ideas, and even the common threads between them were testaments to flexibility, invention, and adaptability!  The others struggled with stiff, fragile limbs, an easily obstructed windpipe, and one huge mass of vulnerabilities above their torso; You found this form wanting, and proved Your place as the supreme deity by continuing to improve on it.  You gave us arms and legs we could twist into any useful shape we could dream of, and instead of dreadfully fragile eyes and throats, we can see, eat, and breathe through our skin, skin laden with neurons rather than one centralized brain.  Even today, even when unconscious and dismembered, You continue to invent, Your Magic of Creativity tweaking the other gods' creations to see what results.  You are not merely a god of light - You are a god of enlightenment, and all who create owe it to You.","source_tag":"_t","target":"啊，#CRIMSON#阿马克泰尔#LAST#！你是阳光普照的大地之上，被地热所温暖的世界深处的一切的崇高主宰！在诸神的纪元中，你在其他人停滞不前之时开启了伟大的创新。其他诸神满足于同样的模板——一种由一个头，薄薄的皮肤，有关节的内骨骼组成的结构——但是你，你有着伟大的创意和想象，你无数的创造的唯一共同点，就是对灵活性，创造性和适应性无尽的追求！当其他的造物受困于僵硬脆弱的四肢，容易堵塞的气管和躯干上方巨大的脆弱部位的时候，你这位至高的神仍然在不断地改进这我们的身躯来证明自己的才华。你给我们创造的四肢可以扭曲成我们想要的任何有用的形状。我们没有眼睛和喉咙这样致命的弱点，可以使用我们的皮肤来看见，进食和呼吸，我们也没有集中的大脑，而是分布在皮肤之中的神经元。即使在今天，即使你已经被肢解，失去意识，你仍然在继续着创造，你创造的魔法不断调整和改进着其他神祇的创造。你不仅是光明之神——你是启蒙之神，所有的造物者都受到了你的启迪。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"77f5cb40b6ed8d5cc8fa847d6a8bf9d8a4e6f088c33a7c5e953368f8c41b2e77","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"3bc6e05d6e85096a515a4e4eda7fd230d4a99db7eaebfc7d52768fd88dd5352f","logical_entry_identity":"2ecb250fe81c53c7136d5f232e74c9fb442652a843ba9ad1c977383166317f89","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"This aged looking saw is very rusty, and you think you see a thin layer of... something... on its blades.","source_tag":"_t","target":"这个上了年头的链锯严重生锈，而且你发现锯刃上有一层薄薄的*东西*。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"8643609808e9bf2a41f387e2265513e39955af7650b52e677ad7023efad73fb1","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"3bcb40c208e9c123fa68e3e8c4fd784d51eee58ff231213dcef0fa1f2e954391","logical_entry_identity":"9dc30152296195b0e3d8e7b7be1e11004d423d41f97fea73c767d9c1e8dc51b3","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"If bleed damage per turn is greater than 5% of max life, attacks cleave.","source_tag":"_t","target":"若每回合流血伤害超过最大生命值的 5%，攻击将变为劈击。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"9e8ad275736af8ae301363bb2a6eb705b5ce520e5e0cd33455ecac40a9620bc5","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"3bd2b4717835e3935bc0a956a8d4eacef8a63f4c723b356cca63d62da0797da4","logical_entry_identity":"2c355ecfafc766b6bc0d5750d981e9ef86adb17dbe2886c0807f710c5d8d0372","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"The Dead God slumbers. For now.","source_tag":"_t","target":"已死之神正在沉睡。起码现在是这样。"